# The Strange House (the house at the edge of Lentimas Town where the rooms do not stay put): a music-box figure on a celesta in
# A minor that turns round on itself, a hushed choir under it, a low string line and a single timpani stroke every second bar. The
# house plays the same by day and by night. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U7, part b).
title Strange House
tempo 72
meter 4/4
reverb 0.5
night none

